122: ## HP8 minimal-product contraction
123: 
124: HP8 removes the research-only `ForeignEgressCapability` / `EffectPathQuery` Python modules and their three packaged contracts after HP4 failed to prove fresh-Agent decision value, HP6 preserved their unique laws/evidence in the research archive, and the Minimal World candidate passed the full portable gate plus the same 96 mixed-chaos invocations. Historical Computing research references do not reactivate the product surface.
